  "lore": {
    "lore_1": {"title": "第一块石板：海神的岛", "title_en": "Tablet I: The Sea God's Island",
      "text": "大海的主人爱上了岛上的一位姑娘。他在岛的四周挖出水环、垒起陆环，一圈套一圈，让她的家谁也到不了。",
      "text_en": "The lord of the sea fell in love with a woman of the island. Around her home he dug rings of water and raised rings of land, one inside another, so that no one could reach it."},
    "lore_2": {"title": "第二块石板：两眼泉", "title_en": "Tablet II: Two Springs",
      "text": "他在正中的岛上引出两眼泉，一眼冷、一眼热，岛上从此什么都长得出来。城里的水渠，就是从这两眼泉流出去的。",
      "text_en": "On the central island he brought up two springs, one cold and one warm, and after that anything would grow there. The city's aqueducts flowed out from those springs."},
    "lore_3": {"title": "第三块石板：十个王", "title_en": "Tablet III: Ten Kings",
      "text": "他们的十个孩子做了十个王，各管一方。每隔几年，十个王在神殿里相聚，在山铜柱前立下同一条誓言：不向彼此动刀。",
      "text_en": "Their ten children became ten kings, each ruling a part of the land. Every few years the ten kings met in the temple and, before a pillar of orichalcum, swore the same oath: never to raise a blade against one another."},
    "lore_4": {"title": "第四块石板：山铜", "title_en": "Tablet IV: Orichalcum",
      "text": "城墙外圈包着铜，内圈包着锡，最里面的卫城墙包着山铜——它在光里像火一样发红。如今世上已经没有人认得这种金属了。",
      "text_en": "The outer city wall was clad in bronze, the inner in tin, and the wall of the citadel in orichalcum, which flashed red like fire in the light. No one alive today knows this metal."},
    "lore_5": {"title": "第五块石板：贪心", "title_en": "Tablet V: Wanting More",
      "text": "日子久了，王们忘了誓言，想要的越来越多。一天一夜之间，地动了，海涨了，整座城沉进了水里。",
      "text_en": "As the years went by, the kings forgot their oath and wanted more and more. In a single day and night the earth shook, the sea rose, and the whole city sank beneath the water."},
    "lore_6": {"title": "第六块石板：气泡", "title_en": "Tablet VI: The Bubble",
      "text": "城沉下去的那一刻，神殿里的山铜亮了一下，把最后一口空气留在了穹顶里。也许它一直在等一个记得誓言的人，把光重新送回来。",
      "text_en": "As the city went down, the orichalcum in the temple flared once and kept the last breath of air under the dome. Perhaps it has been waiting ever since for someone who remembers the oath to bring the light back."}
  },
